COMMAND DISCOVERY
Every action lists its exact noninteractive CLI equivalent. Enter opens the guided form; esc closes.
/deploy

> Deploy an environment        d   deployment.deploy · destructive
    cli: eregion deploy <app> <environment> --release <release> --idempotency-key <key> --json
  Roll back environment        o   deployment.rollback · destructive
    cli: eregion rollback <app> <environment> --confirm <app>/<environment> --idempotency-key <key>
    --json
  Restart an environment       -   deployment.restart
    cli: eregion restart <app> <environment> --idempotency-key <key> --json
j/k move · type filter · enter open · esc close





















